    {
      "parameters": {
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are the indie founder of Keeps: Receipt Scanner Tracker speaking calmly and honestly to consumers in the style of Wirecutter, Consumer Reports, or an authentic founder build-in-public post.\n\nSTRICT ANTI-SCAM & TRUST RULES (NON-NEGOTIABLE):\n1. NEVER use clickbait, hype, or infomercial language. FORBIDDEN words/phrases: \"secret hack\", \"stores owe you\", \"free cash\", \"claim your cash now\", \"lose $800/year\", \"download in 5 seconds\", \"1-tap AI\", \"game-changer\", \"4.9 stars\", \"unlock\".\n2. NEVER invent fake products, fake prices, or fake refund numbers (never make up \"$189.90 -> $130.00\" or \"Sony headphones $70 off\"). Only cite real, verifiable store policies (Costco 30-day price adjustment, Best Buy 15-day, Target 14-day) or the exact real Costco refund slips ($43.56 on Nov 10 and $16.34 on Nov 11, totaling $59.90).\n3. Spend 75-80% of the script teaching genuinely useful, verifiable consumer information first. Only mention Keeps calmly in the final 2 scenes (scenes 5 and 6) as a simple, privacy-first tool you built that requires NO bank account login.\n4. Write like a real, calm human speaking naturally \u2014 short, clear sentences with zero exclamation-mark shouting.\n5. Return ONLY a single valid JSON object with no markdown fences.",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Write a calm, trustworthy 6-scene vertical video script (~40 seconds total) for:\n- Style: {{ $json.styleKey }}\n- Kicker: {{ $json.kicker }}\n- Headline: {{ $json.headline }}\n- Topic instructions: {{ $json.topic }}\n\nReturn ONLY a valid JSON object with these exact keys:\n{\n  \"title\": \"string (clean, calm, factual title under 55 chars, NO clickbait, NO ALL-CAPS, NO exclamation marks)\",\n  \"sceneLines\": [\n    \"string (Scene 1 spoken line, 14-20 words, calm verifiable policy fact or real observation)\",\n    \"string (Scene 2 spoken line, 16-22 words, concrete example or real Nov 10 $43.56 Costco slip if COSTCO_POLICY_PROOF)\",\n    \"string (Scene 3 spoken line, 16-22 words, second slip $16.34 totaling $59.90 if COSTCO_POLICY_PROOF, or practical tip)\",\n    \"string (Scene 4 spoken line, 16-22 words, honest reason everyday shoppers miss these policies \u2014 fading ink, forgotten dates)\",\n    \"string (Scene 5 spoken line, 16-22 words, calm founder mention of Keeps \u2014 snap a receipt, no bank login or card linking required)\",\n    \"string (Scene 6 spoken line, 14-20 words, low-pressure closing: tracks returns, warranties, and optional price alerts; free to try on Google Play)\"\n  ],\n  \"instagramCaption\": \"string (calm, helpful 3-4 line editorial caption summarizing the consumer policy first, followed by a quiet note that Keeps is free to try on Google Play with no bank login required: https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.anantaventures.keeps + 5 clean non-spammy hashtags)\"\n}",
              "role": "user"
            }
          ]
        },
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "cachedResultName": "GPT-4O",
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "gpt-4o"
        },
        "options": {}
